{"seq":2,"slug":"model-withdrawal-form-record","title":"标准撤回表单与下单告知固化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-information/model-withdrawal-form-record","wordCount":1974,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"标准撤回表单与下单告知固化\">标准撤回表单与下单告知固化</h1><p>消费者行权那一刻，系统收到的往往不是一份填满的标准化表单，而是一封措辞随意的邮件、一条客服工单、甚至一句「我不想要了」。法律对形式的要求极低——<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/11\">第 11 条</a>只要求消费者在窗口届满前告知其撤回决定，可以用 Annex I(B) 的标准表单，也可以「任何其他明确表示撤回决定的陈述」，且成员国不得对标准表单附加额外形式要求。这条宽松规定把压力从「消费者怎么表达」转移到了「商家怎么识别、确认与举证」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>撤回权的行权在形式上是<strong>自由的</strong>，在举证上是<strong>有结构的</strong>。法律不要求消费者使用标准表单，只要求他作出「明确表示撤回决定」的陈述，因此系统面对的是一个开放式的文本与行为流；但一旦进入争议，判定「是否行权」和「何时行权」必须能靠结构化记录复现。</p>\n<p>这两个事实的组合定义了本节的设计目标：把非结构化的受理入口转化为结构化的受理记录，且<strong>时间戳语义不能被后续处理污染</strong>。发出时刻、接收时刻与原始载体三者缺一不可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行权的形式自由度与识别责任\">行权的形式自由度与识别责任</h2><p>标准撤回表单的字段本身是固定的。<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/annex/I\">Annex I(B)</a> 包含收货方信息、消费者姓名、订单与收货日期、以及（仅纸质提交时）签名与日期，并附「complete and return this form only if you wish to withdraw from the contract」的说明。但它的使用是<strong>可选</strong>的：「You may use the attached model withdrawal form, but it is not obligatory」。</p>\n<p>这意味着撤回请求的入口是一个<strong>开放式文本流</strong>，而判定它是一个法律行为——因此识别环节必须在窄信任约束下工作：外部文本只作为证据输入，判定结果由自有规则产出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"形式自由度带来的是识别成本-不是免责\">形式自由度带来的是识别成本，不是免责</h3><p>法律允许消费者用任何「明确表示」的方式行权，这在运营上意味着商家<strong>没有立场</strong>以「你没用我们的表单」为由拒绝。反过来说，商家也不能以「识别不到」为借口拖延——只要合理可读出撤回意图，时钟就已经启动。因此受理侧真正要投资的是识别的召回率，而不是形式的规范性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"表单存在的意义是降低双方成本\">表单存在的意义是降低双方成本</h3><p>标准表单的价值不在法律效力，而在两端成本：消费者不必组织措辞，商家不必做语义判定。预填订单号、下单日期与收货日期的电子表单，把一次行权从「写一封邮件」降到「点两下」，这直接减少了因表述模糊导致的复核工单。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>入口渠道</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>识别难度</th>\n<th>是否构成有效行权</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结账账户内「申请撤回」</td>\n<td>结构化表单</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网站标准表单提交</td>\n<td>结构化表单</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮件至客服信箱</td>\n<td>自由文本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是，需语义判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线聊天 / 工单</td>\n<td>自由文本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是，需语义判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电话</td>\n<td>语音 + 工单记录</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是，需记录留痕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货包裹到达</td>\n<td>行为（隐含）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>通常认定为行权表示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"邮件与聊天里的行权识别\">邮件与聊天里的行权识别</h3><p>自由文本识别不能依赖关键词匹配的松散规则，因为它同时要处理两类错误：把咨询当行权（假阳），以及把方言化表达漏掉（假阴）。一个可用的判定链是三层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"classify_intent(message, order_context):&#10;  if message.locale not in supported: escalate_human(message)&#10;  if matches_model_form(message): return WITHDRAWAL_EXPLICIT&#10;  s = semantic_score(message, intent=&#39;withdraw&#39;)   # 模型给出证据分数，非最终判定&#10;  if s &gt;= 0.90: return WITHDRAWAL_EXPLICIT&#10;  if s &gt;= 0.55: return NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW&#10;  if s &lt;  0.55 and mentions(order_context): return OTHER_INTENT&#10;  return UNRELATED&#10;&#10;resolve(review):&#10;  # 人工复核只产出判定，不改变时间戳&#10;  decision = reviewer.decide(review)&#10;  persist(decision, decision_at=review.received_at)   # 保留原始接收时刻\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>classify_intent(message, order_context):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if message.locale not in supported: escalate_human(message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if matches_model_form(message): return WITHDRAWAL_EXPLICIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  s = semantic_score(message, intent='withdraw')   # 模型给出证据分数，非最终判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if s >= 0.90: return WITHDRAWAL_EXPLICIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if s >= 0.55: return NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if s &#x3C;  0.55 and mentions(order_context): return OTHER_INTENT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return UNRELATED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resolve(review):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 人工复核只产出判定，不改变时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  decision = reviewer.decide(review)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  persist(decision, decision_at=review.received_at)   # 保留原始接收时刻</span></span></code></pre></div><p>强制规则是：<strong>复核只决定「是不是行权」，不改写「什么时候到达」</strong>。若复核流程顺手把时间戳更新为复核时刻，一条在窗口最后一天深夜到达的邮件就会在流水线上变成逾期请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间戳语义-发出优先与举证责任\">时间戳语义：发出优先与举证责任</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/11\">第 11(4) 条</a>把行权是否成立的举证责任放在消费者身上，同时规定只要通信在届满前<strong>发出</strong>即视为及时。这两条并置的结果是一个明确的设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>系统必须采集<strong>消费者侧发出的时刻</strong>，而不是平台侧收到的时刻；</li>\n<li>消费者不能完全依赖「发出即算」——他需要能证明自己发出过；</li>\n<li>平台若要抗辩「已过期」，须证明发出时刻晚于届期，而不是证明收到时刻晚于届期。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此受理记录必须同时保留三类时间：消费者声明的发出时刻、平台实际接收的时刻、以及两者所依据的原始载体（邮件头、聊天消息 ID、工单创建时间）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE withdrawal_request (&#10;  request_id      BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  channel         TEXT   NOT NULL,      -- web_form|email|chat|ticket|phone|parcel&#10;  sent_at         TIMESTAMPTZ,          -- 消费者侧发出时刻（消费者主张）&#10;  received_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL, -- 平台接收时刻&#10;  raw_ref         TEXT,                 -- message-id / ticket id / call id&#10;  form_template   TEXT,                 -- &#39;EU_ANNEX_I_B&#39; | null&#10;  intent_decision TEXT NOT NULL,        -- explicit|reviewed|rejected&#10;  decided_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  policy_version_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT sent_never_after_received&#10;    CHECK (sent_at IS NULL OR sent_at &lt;= received_at)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withdrawal_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- web_form|email|chat|ticket|phone|parcel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sent_at         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 消费者侧发出时刻（消费者主张）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  received_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 平台接收时刻</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  raw_ref         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- message-id / ticket id / call id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  form_template   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'EU_ANNEX_I_B' | null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intent_decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- explicit|reviewed|rejected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sent_never_after_received</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sent_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sent_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> received_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sent_never_after_received</code> 这条约束会挡住一类真实的脏数据：用户在时区转换或客户端时钟错误的情况下，产出一个晚于服务端接收时刻的「发出时刻」。约束触发时应进入人工核验，而不是静默接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电子行权的即时确认\">电子行权的即时确认</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/11\">第 11 条</a>规定：若卖家提供网站电子提交途径，则须在<strong>耐久介质</strong>上<strong>及时</strong>向消费者发出收到确认。耐久介质意味着邮件或账户内可留存的消息，而不是一个一闪而过的页面提示。确认里应包含什么并没有法定清单，但工程上必须能支撑后续争议，因此至少要有：请求 ID、涉及的订单行、发出与接收时刻、以及下一步动作与时限。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant C as 消费者&#10;  participant A as 受理服务&#10;  participant E as 耐久介质(邮件/站内信)&#10;  participant O as 订单服务&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;A: 提交撤回(表单或自由文本)&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;A: 识别意图 + 采集原始时刻&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;O: 解析该订单行撤回资格&#10;  O--&gt;&gt;A: 资格结果 + 政策版本&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;E: 发送收到确认(含请求 ID 与时限)&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;O: 推进订单行至 WITHDRAWAL_REQUESTED&#10;  E--&gt;&gt;C: 确认送达(留存投递证据)\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as 消费者\n  participant A as 受理服务\n  participant E as 耐久介质(邮件/站内信)\n  participant O as 订单服务\n  C-&gt;&gt;A: 提交撤回(表单或自由文本)\n  A-&gt;&gt;A: 识别意图 + 采集原始时刻\n  A-&gt;&gt;O: 解析该订单行撤回资格\n  O--&gt;&gt;A: 资格结果 + 政策版本\n  A-&gt;&gt;E: 发送收到确认(含请求 ID 与时限)\n  A-&gt;&gt;O: 推进订单行至 WITHDRAWAL_REQUESTED\n  E--&gt;&gt;C: 确认送达(留存投递证据)</pre><h2 id=\"下单时的告知固化-让表单有上下文\">下单时的告知固化：让表单有上下文</h2><p>撤回表单本身是通用的，但消费者填它时需要三样上下文：订单号、下单日期、收货日期。Annex I(B) 的表单把这些列为待填字段——这对纸质流程合理，对电子流程则是一个应当由系统预填的环节。</p>\n<p>固化做法是在下单成功时写入一条<strong>披露快照</strong>，把「当时告诉了他什么」与「他当时在哪个版本下同意」绑定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: 8813722,&#10;  &quot;captured_at&quot;: &quot;2026-03-02T08:40:02Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;disclosure&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;template_id&quot;: &quot;EU_ANNEX_I_A&quot;,&#10;    &quot;template_version&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;checksum&quot;: &quot;sha256:1f9c…&quot;,&#10;    &quot;fields&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;period_days&quot;: 14,&#10;      &quot;start_rule_key&quot;: &quot;DELIVERY_LAST_GOOD&quot;,&#10;      &quot;return_cost_bearer&quot;: &quot;CONSUMER&quot;,&#10;      &quot;collect_by_trader&quot;: false&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;form&quot;: { &quot;template_id&quot;: &quot;EU_ANNEX_I_B&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: 2, &quot;prefilled&quot;: true },&#10;  &quot;consent&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;checked_at&quot;: &quot;2026-03-02T08:40:01Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;checkout_checkbox&quot;,&#10;    &quot;text_version_id&quot;: 412&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8813722</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"captured_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-03-02T08:40:02Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"disclosure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"template_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU_ANNEX_I_A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"template_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"checksum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:1f9c…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"period_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"start_rule_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DELIVERY_LAST_GOOD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"return_cost_bearer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CONSUMER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"collect_by_trader\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"form\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"template_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU_ANNEX_I_B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prefilled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"consent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"checked_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-03-02T08:40:01Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"checkout_checkbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"text_version_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">412</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>prefilled: true</code> 是一个容易被忽视但很关键的字段：当表单由系统预填了订单与日期，消费者的行权成本降到最低，形式瑕疵导致的无效行权也随之减少。这条与「行权形式自由度」的法律取向是一致的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表单字段与受理记录的映射\">表单字段与受理记录的映射</h2><p>标准表单的字段与受理表的列不是一一对应，需要一层显式映射，否则纸质与电子两条通道会产生结构不同的记录：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Annex I(B) 字段</th>\n<th>受理记录列</th>\n<th>缺失处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>To（收货方）</td>\n<td><code>policy_version_id</code> 反查市场主体</td>\n<td>由政策版本推定，不阻断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I/We hereby give notice</td>\n<td><code>intent_decision</code></td>\n<td>语义判定，需复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>contract of sale / service</td>\n<td><code>order_id</code> + 行项目类型</td>\n<td>缺失则向消费者澄清</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ordered on</td>\n<td>订单 <code>placed_at</code></td>\n<td>系统反查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>received on</td>\n<td><code>delivery_event.last_line_delivered_at</code></td>\n<td>系统反查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name / Address</td>\n<td>账户主数据</td>\n<td>缺失则允许以订单账户为准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Signature（仅纸质）</td>\n<td><code>raw_ref</code>（扫描件）</td>\n<td>纸质通道必填</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>行权形式自由度很高，识别责任因此落在平台侧，需要分层判定并对低置信度转人工。</li>\n<li>复核只决定「是否行权」，绝不能改写原始到达时刻。</li>\n<li>举证责任在消费者、但「发出即算」在平台——受理表必须同时保存发出、接收与原始载体。</li>\n<li>电子行权须在耐久介质上及时确认；确认内容应支撑后续争议而非仅作提示。</li>\n<li>下单时固化披露快照并预填撤回表单，可同时降低形式瑕疵与争议成本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"标准撤回表单与下单告知固化","id":"标准撤回表单与下单告知固化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"行权的形式自由度与识别责任","id":"行权的形式自由度与识别责任"},{"level":3,"text":"形式自由度带来的是识别成本，不是免责","id":"形式自由度带来的是识别成本-不是免责"},{"level":3,"text":"表单存在的意义是降低双方成本","id":"表单存在的意义是降低双方成本"},{"level":3,"text":"邮件与聊天里的行权识别","id":"邮件与聊天里的行权识别"},{"level":2,"text":"时间戳语义：发出优先与举证责任","id":"时间戳语义-发出优先与举证责任"},{"level":2,"text":"电子行权的即时确认","id":"电子行权的即时确认"},{"level":2,"text":"下单时的告知固化：让表单有上下文","id":"下单时的告知固化-让表单有上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"表单字段与受理记录的映射","id":"表单字段与受理记录的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"撤回权告知义务与结账展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-information/withdrawal-notice-checkout-disclosure"},"next":{"title":"政策版本与订单时点快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-information/policy-version-order-snapshot"}}